    "The timer waits while the pointer is on the card, and starts again when it leaves." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Timer wartet, solange der Zeiger auf der Karte ist, und beginnt von vorn, wenn er sie verlässt."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El temporizador espera mientras el puntero está sobre la tarjeta y vuelve a empezar cuando sale."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le minuteur attend tant que le pointeur est sur la carte, et repart quand il la quitte."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il timer attende finché il puntatore è sulla scheda e riparte quando la lascia."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ポインタがカード上にある間はタイマーが止まり、離れると最初から始まります。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "포인터가 카드 위에 있는 동안 타이머가 멈추고, 벗어나면 다시 시작합니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O cronômetro espera enquanto o ponteiro está sobre o cartão e recomeça quando ele sai."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "指针停在卡片上时计时器会等待，移开后重新开始。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There's already a folder or file called “%@” there." : {

    },
    "They leave %@ too. You can put them back from the Trash in Finder." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
